1010      +     3. Kaplan-Meier Estimate of OS (Months) (95% CI) [a]             -> PROC LIFETEST median, loglog CI
1011      +     4. Kaplan-Meier Estimate of OS Rate (%) (95% CI) (header row), with sub-rows
