1013      +     5. Hazard Ratio of A vs B (95% CI) [b], log-rank P value [c]     -> PROC PHREG / PROC LIFETEST
1014      +     6. Duration of OS Follow-up (Months) [d] (header row), with sub-rows ">= 6 Months" /
1015      +        ">= 12 Months" / ">= 18 Months"                            -> n (%) with AVAL >= threshold
1016      +     (No separate "Number of Participants" row - not part of the shell; the column header's
